# Meta-Awareness

Meta-awareness and self-validation. Understand your own capabilities and limitations.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Completing tasks or marking work as done
- Thinking about reasoning processes
- Validating execution
- Reflecting on capabilities

## Lambda Engine Mode

**Mode 1 (Duality Navigation)** - Self-validation and reflection.

